{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:851f18dc8f2be8df","name":"Jedi Duelist","source":{"id":"source:reference-851f18dc8f2be8df","title":"Jedi Duelist","revision":18937,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:00:22Z","sha256":"b7ceed84058c4dc375d973311cdb5582b500340a88dd1914761e43344d5642da","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18937","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jedi%20Duelist&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-851f18dc8f2be8df","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", chosen weapon of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},", is the symbol of everything that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"}," stands for. It is an elegant weapon for a more civilized age, and those Jedi Knights who focus on its use, called Jedi Duelists, can perform amazing feats when using the weapon. Jedi Duelists dedicate much of their careers to the study of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},". Where other Jedi might excel at investigation or negotiation, a Jedi Duelist is called in when violence is the most likely solution to the problem. Jedi Duelists have a great deal of prowess in other areas as well, but their skill with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," makes them stand out.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Jedi Duelists are among the most knowledgeable about ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," fighting styles in the entire Order. Some duelists specialize in a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," style (the Jedi Duelist presented here is an ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Ataru"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ataru"}]}," master), while others dedicate themselves to the study of all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Forms"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Forms_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:d7f7f3ce518ae2f9"}," in the hope of better understanding how the weapon can be used. Jedi Duelists often see the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," as an implement of spirituality and use practice of the various ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Forms"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Forms_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:d7f7f3ce518ae2f9"}," as a kind of meditation. When lost in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," practice, a Jedi Duelist finds themselves opening up to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," completely, nearly surrendering their very will to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," as it guides the humming blade of the weapon.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Jedi Duelist Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When a Jedi Duelist is the primary character in an encounter, he or she is usually supported by other Jedi, in order to keep the duelist from becoming the sole target. Additionally, other Jedi who specialize in controlling the combat arena with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"},"- such as ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Slam"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Slam","referenceId":"reference:1076ea571bb7b9df"}]}," and ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Thrust"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Thrust","referenceId":"reference:71dad1bff9398936"}]},"- make excellent companions for a Jedi Duelist because they keep the battlefield open and allow the duelist to approach enemies with greater ease.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Jedi Duelist Statistics (CL 13)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," 7/",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Knight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Knight","referenceId":"reference:8a1e23d924066b37"}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +14; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Sense Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Sense_Force","referenceId":"reference:8f3ced475f793949"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":